{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"9a1e1886-85c7-4026-8574-0364975d813e","step_index":6,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":0.084874,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"ls -la site/ api/ \u0026\u0026 cat api/routes.md"},"output":"api/:\r\ntotal 4\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 valentinakoniukhova wheel  96 Oct 19 00:10 .\r\ndrwx------ 8 valentinakoniukhova wheel 256 Oct 19 00:10 ..\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 734 Oct 19 00:10 routes.md\r\n\r\nsite/:\r\ntotal 20\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 valentinakoniukhova wheel  224 Oct 19 00:10 .\r\ndrwx------ 8 valentinakoniukhova wheel  256 Oct 19 00:10 ..\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 1105 Oct 19 00:10 app.js\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel  341 Oct 19 00:10 index.html\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   96 Oct 19 00:10 robots.txt\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel  592 Oct 19 00:10 sitemap.xml\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel  121 Oct 19 00:10 styles.css\r\n# API routes (all under /v1/, same domain as the site)\r\n\r\n| Method | Path | Auth | Purpose |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| GET | /v1/notes | none | list public notes (`?limit=`) |\r\n| GET | /v1/notes/{slug} | none | one public note (JSON with `html`) |\r\n| POST | /v1/notes | bearer | create a note |\r\n| PUT | /v1/notes/{slug} | bearer | edit a note |\r\n| POST | /v1/notes/{slug}/reactions | bearer | react (per user) |\r\n| GET | /v1/me | bearer | the signed-in user |\r\n| GET | /v1/me/drafts | bearer | the user's drafts |\r\n| POST | /v1/auth/token | none | sign-in exchange |\r\n\r\nUnauthenticated POST/PUT return 401. Crawlers hitting POST-only paths with GET\r\nwere logging 404s and 405s all September, which is why `/v1/` was added to\r\nrobots.txt on 2026-09-07.\r\n"}}}
